 <h3><u>Meri Tarhaa Koi Yateem Na Ho</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Meri Tarhaa Koi Yateem Na Ho</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <font face=Times size=4><p>Qafla shah ka, haay warid-e-kufa jo huwa, </p> <p>aan kar umme habiba ne sakina se kaha, </p> <p>ay yatima tu mere waste yeh maang dua, </p> <p>are teri tarhaa se kise ko na yatimi de khuda, </p> <p>sunke bazaar me ye umme habiba ki buka, </p> <p>are rookh suwe neza kiya aur sakina ne kaha, Baba</p> <p>Dua mei karti, aamin kaho, meri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar, Babajaan, Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p> </font>
  <ol>
   <font face=Times size=4> <li>Baba yateem ho kar, ehsaas ye huwa hai, kya cheez hai yatimi, har saas hi sazaa hai, Babajan</li> <p>Yeh meri dil ki hai aawaaz suno, meri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar (Babajaan)Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p> <li>Awlaad waalay mujhe ko, kehne lagay yatima, pardes me sakina, par waqt kaisa aya, Babajan</li> <p>Yeh kehke sar pe merey haath rakho, Meri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar, Babajaan, Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p> <li>Yeh aap jaantey hai, jo kaifiyat hai meri, socha kabhi nahi tha, bazaar me phiroongi, babajan</li> <p>To ab dua mei mera saath to do, meri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar, Babajaan, Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p> <li>Kya haal kar diya hai, dekho to ashkiya ne, khaane ko kya milaa hai, zaalim ki taaziyaane, babajan</li> <p>Lagay jo pyaas to bas ashkh piyo, meri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar (Babajaan)Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p> <li>Jeenay se mera dil to, bezaar hochuka hai, baazu bandhe hai sabke, mera gala bandha hai, babajan</li> <p>Meri aseeri ko dekho socho, meri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar (Babajaan)Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p> <li>Kyu(n) zinda hai sakina, itne ghamo ko seh kar, zaalim mujhe bulaae, apni kaneez keh kar, babajan</li> <p>Me khud se kaisay kahu(n) sabr karo baba, meri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar, Babajaan Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p> <li>Beti ki baat sun kar, sar shah ka pukaara, Sakina, sun kar fughaa tumhaari, rota hai dil humaara, (Meri jan)</li> <p>Khuda se mai yehee kehta hu suno, teri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar, Babajaan Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p> </font>
   <li><font size=4></font><font face=Times size=4>Irfan aur Mazhar, rota hai is fughaa(n) par, shabir ki who dukhtar, kehti hai hum se rokar (Zaakiro)</font></li>
  </ol>
  <font face=Times size=4> 
   <dir> 
    <dir> 
     <p>Ye marsiya meri majlis me parho, meri tarhaa koi yatim na ho</p>
    </dir> 
   </dir> <p>Sakina kehti thi ro ro kar, Babajaan Meri tarhaa koi yateem na ho</p></font>
